 "title": "Restriction of open extension by zero",
 "statement": "For an open immersion $j$, the adjunction unit $M\\to j^*j_!M$ is an\nisomorphism on pro-etale module sheaves.",
 "source": {
  "document": "literature/blueprint/master/blueprint/sec-smooth-purity/sk-prop-sf-open-closed-triangle/lem-exc-proetale-open-unit.md",
